### Banking System - uctan uca test (IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Istekleri yukaridan asagiya sirayla calistirin (her istegin solundaki yesil ok).
### Tum istekler api-gateway (8080) uzerinden gider.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 1) Gonderen hesap olustur (SAVING: gunluk limit 100.000)
POST {{gateway}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountHolderName": "Ali Yilmaz",
  "email": "ali.{{$random.integer(1, 1000000)}}@test.com",
  "phone": "5551112233",
  "accountType": "SAVING",
  "initialDeposit": 100000
}

> {%
    client.test("Hesap olusturuldu", () => client.assert(response.status === 201));
    client.global.set("from", response.body.accountNumber);
%}

### 2) Alici hesap olustur
POST {{gateway}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountHolderName": "Ayse Demir",
  "email": "ayse.{{$random.integer(1, 1000000)}}@test.com",
  "phone": "5554445566",
  "accountType": "CURRENT",
  "initialDeposit": 500
}

> {%
    client.test("Hesap olusturuldu", () => client.assert(response.status === 201));
    client.global.set("to", response.body.accountNumber);
%}

### 3) Basarili transfer -> PENDING doner, 1-2 sn sonra COMPLETED olur
POST {{gateway}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "{{from}}",
  "toAccountNumber": "{{to}}",
  "amount": 1000
}

> {%
    client.test("Transfer kabul edildi", () => client.assert(response.status === 202));
    client.global.set("txOk", response.body.id);
%}

### 4) Transfer durumu (beklenen: COMPLETED)
GET {{gateway}}/transactions/{{txOk}}

### 5) Fraud: 50.000 ustu tek transfer -> FAILED, para iade edilir
POST {{gateway}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "{{from}}",
  "toAccountNumber": "{{to}}",
  "amount": 60000
}

> {% client.global.set("txFraud", response.body.id); %}

### 6) Fraud transfer durumu (beklenen: FAILED, "Fraud detected")
GET {{gateway}}/transactions/{{txFraud}}

### 7) Bakiyeler (beklenen: gonderen 99000, alici 1500)
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/{{from}}/balance

###
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/{{to}}/balance

### 8) Hesap hareketleri
GET {{gateway}}/transactions/account/{{from}}

### 9) Yetersiz bakiye -> 422
POST {{gateway}}/transactions/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "{{to}}",
  "toAccountNumber": "{{from}}",
  "amount": 999999
}

### 10) Validasyon hatasi -> 400 (alan bazli hata listesi)
POST {{gateway}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountHolderName": "",
  "email": "gecersiz-mail",
  "accountType": "SAVING",
  "initialDeposit": -5
}

### 11) Guvenlik: ic SAGA endpoint'i disaridan cagrilamaz -> 403
PUT {{gateway}}/accounts/{{to}}/credit?amount=1000000

### 12) Olmayan hesap -> 404
GET {{gateway}}/accounts/000000000000
